OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun event cancelled over
OL,4,Aplanters on route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent Parkrun event was cancelled on
OL,7,FSaturday morning after large planters
OL,8,Fwere installed on the route.
OL,10,FOrganisers of Cylopark Parkrun near
OL,11,FGravesend said the planters had been
OL,12,Fplaced on a cycle path by Kent County
OL,13,FCouncil following concerns about
OL,14,Fvehicles using the path.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the event said it
OL,17,Faims to bring the run back in the near
OL,18,Ffuture with a redesigned route.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
