OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun event cancelled over
OL,4,Aplanters on route
OL,5,
OL,6,FJanet Murray, who has run the course
OL,7,Ffor 13 years, told BBC Radio Kent:
OL,8,F"Typically there would be hundreds of
OL,9,Fpeople having to navigate their way
OL,10,Faround those."
